You can scribble Elbereth in the dust with almost anything,
even your finger, but it only comes out right about 70% of
the time and it will smudge quite easily. There are two
wands that burn a permanent Elbereth and one that engraves
like an anthame. You can also prepare an engraved Elbereth
with a hard gem. You shouldn't do but a couple of letters at
a time until your character is quite advanced. Leave an item
on your prepared Elbereth so the water demon doesn't park
there.
